  "judge_notes": [
    "Merged candidate assay lists into 6 distinct paradigms: HTR, OFT, EPM, NSF, Balance Beam, Hind Limb Clasping. Treated different drugs/doses within HTR (DOPR, Ariadne, analogs, MDL100907 antagonism) as the SAME assay per rubric.",
    "Strain: glm asserted 'C57BL/6J' and 'male only' without textual evidence in the paper; overrode to null and sex='both' based on the explicit Aux KO methods statement of 'sex balanced'.",
    "Housing items set to not_reported because paper does not describe handling, group housing, light cycle, or enrichment for behavioral cohorts.",
    "Balance beam and hind limb clasping: scored D1=Multiple sessions and D3=2-7 days because pretreatment and post-treatment behavioral data were both collected and reported 1 week apart for the same assay.",
    "NSF: B4 ethological scored 1 (feeding is a natural behaviour). E8 food/water scored 1 because the food pellet is physically present in the apparatus.",
    "OFT B1: candidates split between 1 (qwen/gptoss) and 2 (glm); chose score=1 (2-3 measures) reflecting two reported measures (distance and % time moving).",
    "Hind limb clasping setup_restrain=yes (animal lifted by tail during recording).",
    "DOPR/DOI exact doses for HTR dose-response curves not numerically stated in the markdown text; doses_mg_per_kg left empty with low confidence where unclear."
